### Requests for the IntelliJ IDEA HTTP client (or the `ijhttp` CLI), against a local environment.
### Run the two "token" requests first: they store the tokens used by the other requests.
### Environment: http-client.env.json, select "local".

### Token for alice (customer)
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/kestrel/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=commerce-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Token for olivia (admin)
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/kestrel/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=commerce-web&username=olivia&password=olivia

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Search products (public)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/products?q=tent&page=0&size=20

### Get a product (public)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/products/0192f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### My customer profile
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Place an order (change the Idempotency-Key for each new order)
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "0192f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": "0192f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000007", "quantity": 2 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "recipientName": "Alice Martin",
    "line1": "12 Rue des Alpes",
    "city": "Grenoble",
    "postalCode": "38000",
    "countryCode": "FR"
  }
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### My orders
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### One of my orders
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Cancel my order (only while unpaid)
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### [Admin] Search orders
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders?status=PAID
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Ship an order (pay it first: scripts/send-payment-webhook.sh <orderId> <amount>)
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carrier": "Colissimo", "trackingNumber": "6A12345678901" }

### [Admin] Mark as delivered
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Create a product
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "GLOVES-WINTER-M",
  "name": "Winter gloves (M)",
  "description": "Waterproof insulated gloves",
  "price": { "amount": 59.90, "currency": "EUR" },
  "initialStock": 30
}

### [Admin] Stock of a product
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/0192f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Restock a product
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/0192f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delta": 10, "reason": "RESTOCK", "note": "Delivery note DN-2026-0042" }

### Health (actuator port)
GET {{managementUrl}}/actuator/health
